      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "content": "### OpenTelemetry & Grafana Configuration\n\n- **Service Name:** `agentic-commerce`\n- **OTLP Trace Endpoint:** `http://localhost:4318/v1/traces` (HTTP protobuf)\n- **Tempo OTLP Receiver:** Port `4318` (HTTP) / `4317` (gRPC)\n- **Instrumented Signals:**\n  - `commerce.turn`: User request lifecycle & full conversation turn\n  - `gen_ai.chat`: LLM calls with `gen_ai.usage.input_tokens`, `gen_ai.usage.output_tokens`, `gen_ai.usage.total_tokens`\n  - `commerce.tool.{tool_name}`: Tool executions for `search_products`, `get_product_details`, `add_to_cart`, `checkout_cart`, `generate_ap2_mandate`\n\n*Click on any trace in the explorer above to see full span timelines, tool arguments, latency breakdowns, and token metrics.*",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
